ames>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Stiffman</surname><given-names>AR</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Factors associated with successful functioning in American Indian youths.</article-title><source>Am Indian Alsk Native Ment Health Res</source><year>2006</year><volume>13</volume><fpage>23</fpage><lpage>47</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17602407</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B29"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Sawchuk</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Roy-Byrne</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Goldberg</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Manson</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Noonan</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Beals</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Buchwald</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The relationship between post-traumatic stress disorder, depression and cardiovascular disease in an American Indian tribe</article-title><source>Psychological Medicine</source><year>2005</year><volume>35</volume><fpage>1785</fpage><lpage>1794</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16300692</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B30"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Daniel</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Brown</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Dhurrkay</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Cargo</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>O'Dea</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Mastery, perceived stress and health-related behaviour in northeast Arnhem Land: a cross-sectional study</article-title><source>International Journal for Equity in Health</source><year>2006</year><volume>5</volume><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17002809</p